    "reason": "Absolute Z-up metres in the saved 15-degree mesh frame. Courtyard values regularize the original mesh_010 window-edge selections recorded by measure_mesh_pixels in 06_observe_record: F7 selected rows221/280, F6 rows318/378, F5 rows414/473, F4 rows507/565, F3 rows602/660, F2 headrow695. F2 sill remains inferred at7.0 because the annex occludes it. Each named value belongs only to that floor. Roof values individually regularize the eight selected dormer top/bottom pairs saved in12_height_review, with heads near27.32..27.62 and sills25.92..26.08. Sources is empty because this claim interface admits original image views but has no native saved-mesh observation source type; do not mistake these literal semantic interpretations of mesh pixels for drawing-dimension evidence.",
